---
const headingId = 'projects'
---

<section class="home-section" aria-labelledby={headingId}>
  <div class="home-section__head">
    <h2 id={headingId}>Projects</h2>
  </div>
  <ul class="about-chat">
    <li>
      I am building{' '}
      <a
        href="https://firstdistro.com"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        target="_blank"
      >
        FirstDistro
        <span class="visually-hidden"> (opens in new tab)</span>
      </a>
      , account intelligence that catches silent churn and proves the revenue
      you kept.
    </li>
    <li>
      I also built{' '}
      <a
        href="https://uselay.com"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        target="_blank"
      >
        UseLay
        <span class="visually-hidden"> (opens in new tab)</span>
      </a>
      , in-app feedback that lets users point at what's broken instead of
      describing it.
    </li>
    <li>
      I am a Senior Product Designer at{' '}
      <a href="https://sinch.com" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">
        Sinch
        <span class="visually-hidden"> (opens in new tab)</span>
      </a>
      , working on intelligent inbox and AI messaging at scale for businesses.
    </li>
  </ul>
</section>
